# Liaison IDE hop — leftover goal release

**Invariant:** `liaison_ide_hop.ok ∧ departing_attended_tab ∧ native_goal_active ⇒ UpdateGoal(complete)`
same turn — **before** the `RETIRED → <transcript_id>` line. Skip `CreateGoal` on pickup. Harness
`retire_departing_tab` cannot call UpdateGoal (Cursor-native).

## Land phases (a:38474)

| Phase | Harness action | Seat action |
|---|---|---|
| `fired` / `fired_pending` | `quiesce_departing_tab` — stop `--loop` (arm/harvest); **keep** tails, pollers, `ide:` lock; write hop-land record | Do not arm/harvest; do not Ctrl+N |
| `landed` | `retire_departing_tab` — stop tails, release `ide:`, pin budget-exclude | `UpdateGoal(complete)` if leftover goal; `RETIRED → <id>` |
| `expired` | Stay quiesced; `OPERATOR_GATE` with `message_path` | Manual paste once if needed; **never** re-fire Ctrl+N (a:38364) |

Land proof: resume-fence `armed` (preferred) then transcript fallback (≥600s window). Keystroke alone is not land.

| Meaning | `UpdateGoal(complete)` on hop? |
|---|---|
| House arc / scoreboard fully closed | Yes (arc close) |
| Hop landed; leftover native goal still injecting | **Yes** (stop continuation-wake; 11912) |
| Hop landed; no native goal | No-op — watcher shell completions are the wakes (`event-only-seat-wake_ulg.mdc`) |
| Loop stopped; no hop | Only if a leftover goal is injecting or the objective is met |

**Tool (verbatim, only if a goal is active):** `CallDynamicTool(namespace="cursor", toolName="UpdateGoal", arguments={"status":"complete"})`.

**Script cues:** `liaison-ide-hop.py` JSON field `goal_release`; stderr `LIAISON_HOP_TAB_GOAL_RELEASE` (see
`libs/bus_watch/ide_hop_retire.GOAL_RELEASE`). Quiesce cue: `LIAISON_HOP_TAB_QUIESCE`.

**Successor:** **Jupiter / COSMIC:** attach each ARM label (`watch-supervise.sh tail --label L`, background Shell,
`block_until_ms 0`, no `notify_on_output`). **Cursor-on-Xvfb `:8`:** push-wake only — rely on
`endpoint_wake_dispatcher` -> `display-chat-wake` (`BRIDGE_WAKE`); do **not** spawn or attach
`watch-supervise.sh` / `watch-bus-consult-and-page.py`. Do not `CreateGoal`. House pollers survive
retire; tab tails die with the departing tab on Jupiter hops only.

**Anti-pattern:** Minting `CreateGoal` so the Goals panel is non-empty — Cursor then injects unthrottled
continuation wakes. Primary house wake is the watcher tail's shell completion, not a pattern notify (friction 37400).

Playbook: Use the `ide-continuity` skill § Wakes · command `.cursor/commands/liaison.md` Hop section.
